LangName: 1033 "+AKkA 2023, Copyright by Lineto. All rights reserved." ".+AH8A" "+AH8A" "" "" "Version 5.000; build 0008" "" "Ivory is a trademark of Lineto" "Lineto" "Aurele Sack (2017-2023)" "LL Ivory is designed by Aur+AOgA-le Sack, released by Lineto in 2023. Initially developed in early 2017 upon commission from sVogue Hommes in Paris, it was inspired by an obscure American-style wood type design from the early 19th century. After many rounds of reconsiderations and refinements, it developed into a sophisticated, diverse family of serif fonts +IBMA available in three styles for text, display and monospaced use. Font engineering and mastering by Alphabet Type GmbH." "https://www.lineto.com" "https://www.lineto.com/The+-Designers" "No use of this font is allowed without Lineto+IBkA-s consent and without the user+IBkA-s compliance with the Lineto EULA and the SUL. Lawful use of the fonts or the data contained within the font files excludes modifying, reassembling, renaming, storing on publicly available servers, redistributing and selling. Lineto fonts or any of the data contained within them, including but not limited to rasterized glyph outlines, metrical data, kerning and hinting information, to create new fonts or font-based services using artificial neural networks, machine learning algorithms, or any other generative processes is strictly prohibited. This includes any automated processes, deep learning models, or any other AI-based methods to generate or modify fonts based on the data contained in the original Font Software. Any unlawful use of this typographic software will be prosecuted. For additional information see https://lineto.com/licensing." "https://lineto.com/licensing"
